{"seq":18,"slug":"design-systems-tokens","title":"设计系统与设计令牌","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.25,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"设计系统与设计令牌\">设计系统与设计令牌</h1><p>设计系统（Design System）是产品 UI 的&quot;工业化&quot;——把 ad hoc CSS 与 component 提升为 systematic、versioned、cross-platform 的产品基础设施。Design Token 是其原子层——把 color、spacing、typography 等 design decision 抽象成 named variable（如 <code>color.primary.500</code>、<code>spacing.md</code>），让 Web / iOS / Android 共享同一 source of truth。Material Design（Google 2014）、Apple HIG、IBM Carbon、Atlassian Design、Salesforce Lightning、Spectrum（Adobe）、Polaris（Shopify）是 industry-standard。Style Dictionary（Amazon）让 token JSON 自动生成 CSS / iOS / Android variable。Figma Tokens / Tokens Studio 让 designer 与 engineer 同步。本 Hub 给 frontend / 设计工程师工程化路径——基础（design system 概念、atomic design、token 概念、治理）、token 架构（tier、color 主题、typography、spacing）、工具与流水线（Style Dictionary、Figma sync、跨平台、版本）、采纳与规模化（componentization、a11y、multi-brand）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[设计系统与设计令牌] --&gt; B[1. 设计系统基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[2. 令牌架构]&#10;    A --&gt; D[3. 工具与流水线]&#10;    A --&gt; E[4. 采纳与规模化]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Atomic / Token / Governance]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Tier / Color / Typography / Spacing]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Style Dictionary / Figma sync / 版本]&#10;    E --&gt; I[组件化 / a11y / Multi-brand]\">graph TD\n    A[设计系统与设计令牌] --&gt; B[1. 设计系统基础]\n    A --&gt; C[2. 令牌架构]\n    A --&gt; D[3. 工具与流水线]\n    A --&gt; E[4. 采纳与规模化]\n    B --&gt; F[Atomic / Token / Governance]\n    C --&gt; G[Tier / Color / Typography / Spacing]\n    D --&gt; H[Style Dictionary / Figma sync / 版本]\n    E --&gt; I[组件化 / a11y / Multi-brand]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>实战代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设计系统基础</td>\n<td>Atomic design、token、governance</td>\n<td>Material、Carbon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌架构</td>\n<td>Tier、color、typography、spacing</td>\n<td>Spectrum、Polaris</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具与流水线</td>\n<td>Style Dictionary、Figma sync</td>\n<td>Amazon、Shopify</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳与规模化</td>\n<td>组件化、a11y、multi-brand</td>\n<td>Salesforce、Adobe</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学完本 Hub 你将能从零搭建 design token 流水线、设计 multi-tier token architecture、推动 design system 在公司 adoption、解决 multi-brand / multi-theme 工程问题。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-system-foundations","title":"设计系统基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/design-system-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-design-system","title":"什么是设计系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/design-system-foundations/what-is-design-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"atomic-design-and-components","title":"Atomic Design 与组件化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/design-system-foundations/atomic-design-and-components"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-tokens-fundamentals","title":"设计令牌基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/design-system-foundations/design-tokens-fundamentals"},{"seq":4,"slug":"design-system-governance","title":"设计系统治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/design-system-foundations/design-system-governance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"token-architecture","title":"令牌架构","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"token-categories-and-tiers","title":"令牌类别与层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/token-categories-and-tiers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-tokens-and-theming","title":"颜色令牌与主题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/color-tokens-and-theming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"typography-tokens","title":"排版令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/typography-tokens"},{"seq":4,"slug":"spacing-and-layout-tokens","title":"间距与布局令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/spacing-and-layout-tokens"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tooling-and-pipeline","title":"工具与流水线","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"style-dictionary","title":"Style Dictionary 构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/style-dictionary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"figma-tokens-and-sync","title":"Figma 令牌与同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/figma-tokens-and-sync"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-platform-distribution","title":"跨平台分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/cross-platform-distribution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"versioning-and-changelog","title":"版本管理与变更日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/versioning-and-changelog"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"adoption-and-scale","title":"采纳与规模化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/adoption-and-scale","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"componentization-strategy","title":"组件化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/adoption-and-scale/componentization-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"accessibility-in-design-system","title":"设计系统中的无障碍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/adoption-and-scale/accessibility-in-design-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-brand-and-themes","title":"多品牌与主题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/adoption-and-scale/multi-brand-and-themes"}]}]}